Description: R interfaces to the 'Stata' 'tabtools' 2.5.1 table workflows:
    descriptive and regression tables, categorical cross-tabulations,
    correlations, survival summaries, cell formatting, incidence rates,
    binary outcome ratios, treatment effects and composite tables.
    Supports fit-time count records, publication masking, editable table
    frames and shared output destinations. Writes house-styled 'Excel',
    Markdown and CSV tables and converts tables for Word, HTML and LaTeX.
    Targets the pinned native table structure and formatting while
    documenting differences in statistical inference, numerical boundaries
    and the separation of analytical returns from publication values.
